{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_title", "source_sha256": "c05a2d856039e7df6b627499f1ec4516cc1e66d4e3902a1d222a57c26914a0ba", "ja": "そのきらめきは天然成分", "zh": "那份光芒是纯天然成分", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c8f1b398a1f766254c8f6649d39ea1a56492d0ecba87b4dbb9486cb383cf7d20", "ja": "CMの決め台詞を考えるのり子。これと\nいったものが思い浮かばないまま時間が\n過ぎる中、ともに悩んでくれている\nプロデューサーにかけた何気ないひと言に\nこそ、彼女の魅力が詰まっていた。", "zh": "法子正在思考广告里的招牌台词。在迟迟\n想不出好点子、时间一分一秒流逝之际，\n她对一同烦恼的制作人随口说出的\n一句话，恰恰凝聚了她的魅力所在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1000_043nor", "source_sha256": "d99f735036f84501744d399d3de557953398cbd68258e17d33d93c4a525acadc", "ja": "もうちょっと弾けた感じかな……。\n「運動の後はこれ！　ぐびぐび飲めちゃう微炭酸！」", "zh": "应该是要更活泼欢快一点的感觉吧……\n“运动之后就选这个！大口畅饮微碳酸！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1001_043nor", "source_sha256": "a67a3cab14c5a60e0b18e547bcb2557726eb1f9ce7b47ae387a8f8dbd2fb92b2", "ja": "……いや、弾けた感じって何？　これで合ってる？", "zh": "……不对，所谓的活泼感觉是指什么？这样对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1002_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1003_401pro", "source_sha256": "673ef7c63901fbb62cc599b46c119706ea8d1326769fec3c05869a63b706be5f", "ja": "あれ？　のり子、まだ残ってたのか。\n打ち合わせが終わったの、だいぶ前だよな？", "zh": "咦？法子，你还没走吗？\n碰头会应该早就结束了吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1004_043nor", "source_sha256": "9171fb45002a7e2337d1ecdbf488ae427091dfe063b12e8fef722e3d89a1747c", "ja": "プロデューサー。いや、CMの決め台詞で悩んでて……\nほら、打ち合わせで台詞の内容まで任されたでしょ？", "zh": "制作人。不是，我正在为广告的点睛台词伤脑筋……\n你看，之前不是连台词内容都交给我来决定了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1005_401pro", "source_sha256": "dec7c7b68b3d7f9a1c63c5555fb42a596925fd1789912efe13e108f5be701e9d", "ja": "のり子らしさも出したい、ってことだったよな。\nありがたいじゃないか。", "zh": "还说想展现出你的风格，对吧。不是挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1006_043nor", "source_sha256": "94909046d5bff259e7ddd0d15c32f5437bfa5777a8b2b2e1f8df4be68b57c3c2", "ja": "そうなんだけど、いざアタシらしさ、なんて\n言われるとさ。どうしたもんかな、と……。", "zh": "是这么说没错，可真要让我表现出自己的风格，反倒让我有点不知该怎么办……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "9c3aba0d9695dfd10dd178568adf9605716f12a8cdcf17f47af172862a435608", "ja": "あっ、こんなのどうかな？\n「ぷっは～っ！　最高！！」……ダメ？", "zh": "啊，这样的怎么样？\n“噗哈——！太棒了！！”……不行吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1008_401pro", "source_sha256": "cc8c169f54682c438222740993607306890834ee7bebf9a4adf596e5c8897803", "ja": "はは、わかりやすくていいと思うよ。ストレートだし。\nそれで行ってみるか？", "zh": "哈哈，我觉得这样简单易懂挺好的。也很直接。\n要不要就用这个试试？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1009_043nor", "source_sha256": "282b2b95df14f55eb2d8dd44cf670aa95b75c933864e97df5e95397208ab9919", "ja": "あ、うん……、いや。\nごめん、もうちょい考えてみるよ。", "zh": "啊，嗯……不，还是算了。\n抱歉，我再稍微想想。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1010_401pro", "source_sha256": "78dead6e737c391d791c01b6385963d1a0587d3f5a4c28da8cd5358b432cdfed", "ja": "？　いいけど、今のはどこが引っかかったんだ？", "zh": "？可以啊，不过刚才是哪里卡住了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1011_043nor", "source_sha256": "ca17c0f24e925b7b7ad8e8bd9deba04d9609c401cad5e419779c67e1fd813a94", "ja": "引っかかったわけじゃないけど……。\nなんか、足りてない感じ？", "zh": "倒也不是觉得哪里有问题……\n只是感觉，好像还差点什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1012_043nor", "source_sha256": "c1763166681435c60f22acbf28fb07bcbe6f93bb0c92fb1624812cc03e41e179", "ja": "だってこの仕事、アタシを信じて、期待して任せてくれ\nたってことだよね。初仕事で、超新人のアタシなのに。", "zh": "毕竟，这份工作是因为你相信我、对我有所期待，才交给我来做的，对吧。明明是我的第一次工作，而我还是个彻头彻尾的新手。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1013_043nor", "source_sha256": "a705f57746eda1bd22bf9e9d6a759bf18e159766c7358dbd409c25db04956669", "ja": "だったら「絶対これ！」っていう台詞じゃなきゃ\nダメだと思って。", "zh": "所以我觉得，必须是那种“绝对就是这个！”的台词才行。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1014_043nor", "source_sha256": "0c2d4b35d771f74adc1f655a4543d14e7308f378406ee35d6d7b74d655c9855d", "ja": "だって、信じてくれる人の期待に応えるのがアイドル。\n……なんでしょ？", "zh": "因为，偶像就是要回应那些信任自己的人的期待。\n……是这样吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1015_401pro", "source_sha256": "977c6d5f70d4a98e55f49bc0858a9590239e789014858c8488802ef410b96f0f", "ja": "……。その通り。\nよし！　じゃあ別の切り口で考えてみるか！", "zh": "……。正是如此。\n好！那就换个角度想想吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1016_043nor", "source_sha256": "91d3b39aef5551b395c0b34d39f2439077b965c1bdca0e3675393a7b87254400", "ja": "うん！　って、別の切り口って何だろう……。\nん～～。", "zh": "嗯！不过，所谓的另一个切入点是什么呢……\n唔～～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1017_043nor", "source_sha256": "c7382d87706115b4a37f5df516645b11cf86669dbe3d5d3205d467c7a8450b61", "ja": "「飲み口、スコーピオン・デスロック！」\n……これは違うよね、たぶん。", "zh": "“口感如同蝎式固定！”\n……这不对吧，大概。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1018_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1019_043nor", "source_sha256": "8d917ea1d4fcbf7b79303c187f8d6d9f1b4ea323d530c16fe89e0027112e54ab", "ja": "ダメだ、も～！　決め台詞が決まらない～！", "zh": "不行啦，真是的～！标志性台词怎么都定不下来～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1020_043nor", "source_sha256": "6f2c3cba2ba3f1b8aec7799b5ce73bd9ced3220a16bd84d46927933b69ed1ec1", "ja": "なんかごめんね、結局プロデューサーまで\n付き合わせちゃって……。", "zh": "总觉得有点对不起你，结果连制作人都被我拉来一起想了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1021_401pro", "source_sha256": "81d4a2e7db925a3542ca62dffd364e6a090ccb1d01366a0ed63a62a830ced5f7", "ja": "いや、ここで付き合わないでどうするんだ。\n最高の決め台詞、絶対考えような！", "zh": "不，我要是不陪你到这里，接下来该怎么办？\n我们一定要想出最棒的收尾台词！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1022_043nor", "source_sha256": "8651b376dd986082906e1c833ef1445faac26048274090524f733fd3d70c97df", "ja": "……うん。ありがと。", "zh": "……嗯。谢谢啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1023_401pro", "source_sha256": "054a935112ac74ac1d6341ee7c314c31f9330ac048ff293e18f14066950bc42a", "ja": "商品のアピールポイントは爽やか、微炭酸、果実、\n甘酸っぱさ……狙ってる客層を考えたら……うーん……", "zh": "商品的卖点是清爽、微碳酸、果实、\n酸甜……考虑到目标客群的话……唔——……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1024_043nor", "source_sha256": "64fb7e6972b37f03bdd2d3e99a61d877bbdfbea2d9d4ef095211c9d7a14a80c7", "ja": "って、ありがたいけど、すごい眉間のしわだよ？\nもうちょっとリラックスした方がいいのかも。", "zh": "不过，虽然很感谢你，你这眉头皱得也太厉害了吧？\n或许还是稍微放松一点比较好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1025_043nor", "source_sha256": "5b678aa67b927bad0712627ae154695cdf2410cc34d6a01e121bce9ef85ac47f", "ja": "あ、そうだ。ドリンクのサンプル、\nいっぱいもらったよね。せっかくだから……", "zh": "啊，对了。我们拿到了好多饮料样品吧。难得有这个机会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1026_043nor", "source_sha256": "9b863128f23c067f76d5555fe06463c75c6008ce91ab9c0da01f56d42035e023", "ja": "……ね？　飲んでみる？", "zh": "……呐？要喝喝看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1027_401pro", "source_sha256": "b6ddffb497ceb9a0775e19529879162645250c37d661559aec1f5eb7e124f4a2", "ja": "……！\n今の、いい！！", "zh": "……！\n刚才的感觉很好！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1028_043nor", "source_sha256": "58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a", "ja": "えっ？", "zh": "咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1029_401pro", "source_sha256": "d91919d96c72957f60ac8fe769a1e1a48d63cd25b827bc361cbe6c28d32618e3", "ja": "気取らずに、ふとした瞬間にドキッとさせるような……\nうん、のり子にもこの商品にもピッタリだと思う！", "zh": "不刻意，却能在不经意的瞬间让人心头一跳……\n嗯，我觉得这和你、还有这个商品都很合适！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1030_043nor", "source_sha256": "0eb84152b88b172a3f738fc04dc7be61e4dbf5f33e24102ea7e47835d5063cc7", "ja": "ド、ドキッと！？　いや、でもアタシ、\n別に変な意味とか無くて、普通に聞いてみただけだよ？", "zh": "怦、怦然心动！？　不、不过我也没什么奇怪的意思，就是普通地问了一下而已啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1031_401pro", "source_sha256": "bf97bd8b60c39dd03cd98fe7e36abb0d008b9015e67084a966bd62b1ea776b15", "ja": "そこがよかったんだよ。\nきっとのり子の素の優しさ、可愛さが出たんだな！", "zh": "就是那点好啊。\n一定是因为展现出了你自然流露的温柔和可爱！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0306_story_03_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0306_story_03_1032_043nor", "source_sha256": "f6941880d2ad1401699e67cf8cc01d334ece7b0e938948086210ec4349d2ab8f", "ja": "な……っ！\nいや優しさとか、アタシ、そんな……っ！？", "zh": "哪……！\n不、不是说什么温柔啊，我、我才没有……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
